messages "trout**To: tatsuoSubj: balls of steelDate: Jul 30	You go with your bad self. As usual, Akira and I will be there to offer  any help necessary. (But we are sick and tired of working with idiots, so   don't be that guy!)					-Trout & Akira**kurt**To: tatsuoSubj: MUD politicsDate: Dec 16	I have read your message in the Adv. guild about the state of this MUD. I have to say that I really agree with a lot of the things you said. Not that I was ever in a position to wield a lot of power around here, but I have been around long enough to see how things work. Mangla IS destroying this place. He doesn't want people, he wants power. We need a serious revamping of the Arch situation. 	I have, on many occasions seen wizzes ignore people yelling about bugs, while they sit in the church and talk about what they're doing that weekend or other such things. That, I think, is why this MUD is how it is. Not because of outright hostility (for the most part), but because of indifference. Not caring about fellow players. 	When I started here, there were 25-30 people nightly. People got along, PKs PK-ed. Chatters chatted. Wizzes were too busy coding or helping to lie, slander and fight. A lot of the good ones, like you, have been banished. No one can endanger the almighty Mangla's choke-hold on the MUD... 	We need people who care, and people who are willing to work. If we want this to happen, we are going to need some useful admins. 	I have very little experience coding, but I would be happy to wiz and give it a shot if things were looking up. Ask anyone around though, I have always helped newbies out, coins, armour, walks around. 	I really hate to see this MUD fall apart, it is the only one that i have really played. I am just trying to say that I am willing to do my part if it means turning things back to how they were.	I really don't care if this mail is wiz-read. I don't have a lot of fans in that section anyway, because I tend to speak up and tell the truth as I see it.		Kurt/Manson**saffrin**To: tatsuoSubj: need to talk to youDate: Feb  6I need to talk to you, it is really important.Not on here though.I can be found on backyardamaterasu.math.orst.edu 1996 as FairymoonIt is a chat line**haplo**To: tatsuoSubj: hiyaDate: Feb 14Hey i think you might be on the right track here. If you really want backI would suggest making a mailing to just the arches as an apology. And maybe follow it up with a request to start off as a new wiz(just being a start)I still believe you could be good for the mud.Please do not forward this to the other arches. I can be much more helpfulIf I remain outside of everything (at least to most peoples eyes.)  Hey best of luck,   Haplo aka some guy named Mark**airborne**To: tatsuoSubj: Reinstatement.Date: Jun  9Hey man.I heard what you said before, and I can understand the way you feel.However, there's nothing I can do about it.  In the past month I'vebeen demoted without word, had a sham of a vote about me being an archwizard, and to top it all off... my player file mysteriously vanishedthis week.I told you after you apologized to me that I would no longer get in the way of you wizzing again, and I have stayed behind that.  I think that's what pissed off Napoleon, and why all these little unexplained occuranceskeep happening.  W.**mangla**To: tatsuoSubj: HarrassmentCc: airborne silas sauron haplo kryll meechamDate: Jun 13Hello,    Could you please cease your harrassment of me. I feel I havedone nothing to deserve this treatment. 80%+ of the items youlay the blame on me for I did not do and had no part of. Thiscontinual use of foul and abusive language is starting to wearthin. If you have nothing constructive to say, then please keepyour comments to yourself.-Mangla**nunu**To: tatsuoSubj: HEY DUDE, I'm BACKDate: Jun 30Yo TATSUO, What are you up to dude?I'm back!Drop me a note here, or atnunu@wam.