n a year or more and do nothave areas I have to worry about. I have also made a list ofsome wizards that is thier areas are removed or redone, then Ican remove. Would you like to work on one of them?As far as summoners, they need a looking over. If you haveever tried to read that code you would know some of the problems.I am not opposed to them if they are updated, just not in thiercurrent manifestation.Wilbie will not be archwiz. I know it sound bad, but foratleast the next little while I have no desire to have morearchwizzes without seeing more work to get here. Wilbie, fromthe times I have talked to him, has no desire to really advance.He just wants to be here, create area and code cool things, andbe happy with his life.As for suspecting you of cheating with that mail I have thesereasons to ask you about the heals and such:  You are the first to do much of that besides me in the logs,    and I do check logs.  If I do not ask, and someone complains, then you will have    to listen to them and be a defendant. If I ask you up front    and you give me the answer, then it heads off the \"misinformed\"    complaints. I figured it was good cheer, I do it sometimes    also, but I just had to make sure.  I ask everyone that has entries like that. Standard policy.    does not mean you will be court martialed. ;)If you have specific things you want to work on, or would likeme to give you suggestions them please let me know. But theseare things that YOU want, not that you think Wilbie wants. Heis a big boy and can speak for himself.Hope that answers some of the concerns.-Mangla**zathras**To: tatsuoSubj: can you fix these things?Cc: khufuDate: Jan 12 players/turbo/rooms/elder/center1when you attack URZA &/or MISRA, sometimes there is a 0.  WHYplayers/turbo/rooms/elder/elder1/players/turbo/rooms/darkside/smoke/front_of_cabinSee the comments in this file (not elder1, the comment in front_of_cabin)players/turbo/rooms/elder/gre