ses.nothing to enhance killing or defense.Other than that, use your imaginationGood luck, will help with anything you needTats**bobo**To: tatsuoSubj: loaddir /players/bobo/krooms/villDate: Jan 31works now :)**bobo**To: tatsuoSubj: ClanDate: Jan 31Well I tried to figure out exactly what all the problems that I was havingwith the clan but I couldn't.  I left a list of actions that I want to codein /players/bobo/clan/actions/actionsI did several things, and I tried seveeral others.  They failed but I didattempt it.  I made changes to hachimaka.c, well actually it's now helmet.cI changed defines.h.  I attempted to change several of the action files, espedially _cwho but was unsuccessful.  So I recopied the _cwho from your dirbecause it's not buggy and mine is.  Anyway I'm out, maybe you can tell me a little about how to recode things, or make the new actions.  the thing that really threw me and I have no clue about is with the _cwho.cI only changed tatsuo to bobo, hachimaka to helmet, and house of shimabukuto worshipers of the sun and it bugged on me.  Let me know.  ThanksBobo**bobo**To: tatsuoSubj: WellDate: Jan 31Well I think that I've got it.  The desc seems to work as well as the server,the action file, AND the commands that I have programmed.  You might wantto look it over, to see what you think, or if there are any bugs, but I amrather confident that there aren't any.  Thanks for your patience, now Ican desseminate the membership around the mud so that we can wipe your clan out:)Talk to you laterBobo**thumper**To: thumperSubj: mapCc: tatsuoDate: Feb  5    (enter)      |      |     (hall1)      _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (chamb1a)                            |                            |                         (chamb1b)                            |                            |                         (chamb1c)    (hall2)------------------|       |       |       |     (dcave1)---------(move b