 guarding it would give much more, so it's onlynominal, but it makes it more interesting. Eg if you alredy wished for astat and an hour later you hack up all the guards again and couldn't wish fora stat increasement you can wish for exp, or for a weapon or armor, and therecould be several different magic items available and when you wish for a weapon, you get a random weapon or one selected for your guild or whatever.                                             well, see you                                              Ati**wilbie**To: tatsuoSubj: assassinateCc: boboDate: Mar 11It's absence was annoying players.  Mangla fixed it.  I want to re-do itsometime, make it a little more interesting - maybe different effects forcertain weapons.  For now it's okay.Kotte kuboto no-o 0 shimeyo!**bobo**To: tatsuoSubj: bug in ninja_weapon.cCc: wilbie boboDate: Mar 11%Division by zeroprogram: players/tatsuo/guild/nweap/ninja_weapon.cobject : players/tatsuo/guild/nweap/katana#6300line   : 111 %Division by zeroprogram: players/tatsuo/guild/nweap/ninja_weapon.cobject : players/tatsuo/guild/nweap/katana#6300line   : 111 hopefully that worked...um dorr found it maybe you could look at it...i'lllook at it maybe sometime too, just not now I'm 4/8 asleep and don't wantto play anything when I'm likely to fall asleep while typingZZZzzzzzzzzzzz....zzzz...zz..z**cantus**To: manglaSubj: /players/turbo/MANGLA.cCc: exos, tatsuoDate: Mar 11All ready for inspection.  The comment I added at the beginning explains what i did.I think the lines I changed start around 350 or something.I didn't try to fix other gramatical typos or fix the bug in the one command.I'll leave that for the Experts!Anla'shok Na Turbo, Anla'shok Zathras, and Anla'shok-trainee Cantus**turbo**To: tatsuoSubj: the fileDate: Mar 12I sent it to you so you didnt think I was talking behind your back.Anything I have to say about you, I will be more than happy to tell you.I 